{"code":"294140","name":"레몬","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 2012년 설립되어 모회사 톱텍의 전기방사 기술을 이전받아 기능성 나노소재 전문기업으로 출범함. 2025년 라임과의 합병으로 나노멤브레인, H&B, 필터 3대 사업부 체제를 완성하며, 필리핀 Finetex Technology와 광석태양광발전소를 보유하고 있음. 나노사업부는 아웃도어 멤브레인, 모바일 VENT, 방열소재를 생산하고 H&B는 생리대와 마스크를, 필터는 방호복 및 에어필터 미디어 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2305.0,"open":2275.0,"high":2340.0,"low":2200.0,"volume":16387,"amount":37772035.0,"ret_1d":1.0965,"gap":-0.2193,"range_pct":6.0738,"ret_5":-3.3543,"ret_20":-14.1527,"ret_60":18.2051,"ret_120":-36.061,"ret_250":-68.9771,"ma20":2626.25,"ma60":2331.5667,"ma120":2476.2333,"ma200":3547.59,"close_vs_ma200":-35.0263,"close_vs_ma60":-1.1394,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":411.2056,"r2_60":0.5829,"slope_120":-34.4902,"r2_120":0.1223,"slope_250":-78.1234,"r2_250":0.8073,"high52":9500.0,"low52":1200.0,"pos_52w":13.3133,"dd_52w":-75.7368,"mdd_1y":-82.2209,"atr14_pct":8.9712,"vol_ann_60":76.5239,"vol_avg20":22793.35,"vol_ratio20":0.7189,"vr5":0.5668,"vr20":0.3018,"amount_avg5":51196731.0,"amount_avg20":61194458.75,"amount_avg60":88613611.5,"obv_chg20":18.6089,"turnover_20":1.8297,"pv_eff_20":-7.735,"rsi14":38.1073,"frgn_net_5":17492.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0702,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0702,"frgn_net_20":47752.0,"inst_net_20":3000.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.1917,"inst_net_20_pct":0.012,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2037,"frgn_net_60":58778.0,"inst_net_60":3000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.2359,"inst_net_60_pct":0.012,"smart_net_60_pct":0.248,"frgn_net_120":-37577.0,"inst_net_120":3000.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1508,"inst_net_120_pct":0.012,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.1388,"foreign_ratio":1.47,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.22,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":-9.0,"op_margin_q":-15.0,"op_qoq":57.1429,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":30.7692,"rev_yoy":650.0,"op_trend_4q":21.3699,"fin_period":"202606","roe":null,"debt_ratio":277.24,"per":null,"pbr":7.84